# The last matching pattern wins, so later lines override earlier ones.
# A PR needs an approval from an owner of every file it touches.

# Everything not listed below: payments, Min side, API routes, lib, util,
# Studio config and plugins, dependencies, CI and config.
*  @fellmirr

# Display components, styling, forms, e2e tests, and the Sanity schemas and
# queries that new blocks need. Elise can approve these after checking the
# Vercel preview.
